Input: {"question": "Which organization, club or musical group is Unterwachingen a member of?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 120, "text": "**HEADLINE:** Unterwachingen Joins Ranks of Global Tech Leaders, Becomes Member of International Telecommunication Union"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 122, "end": 453, "text": "**BADEN-WÜRTTEMBERG, GERMANY** - In a move hailed as a significant milestone for the region, the municipality of Unterwachingen has officially become a member of the International Telecommunication Union (ITU), a specialized agency of the United Nations responsible for issues related to information and communication technologies."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 454, "end": 639, "text": "The announcement was made yesterday at a press conference held at the Unterwachingen Town Hall, where Mayor, Herrmann Schneider, was joined by ITU representatives and local dignitaries."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 640, "end": 705, "text": "\"This is a proud moment for our community,\" said Mayor Schneider."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 706, "end": 843, "text": "\"By joining the ITU, we are demonstrating our commitment to embracing the latest technologies and staying at the forefront of innovation."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 844, "end": 988, "text": "This membership will open up new opportunities for our residents, businesses, and institutions to collaborate with global leaders in the field.\""}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 989, "end": 1130, "text": "The ITU, founded in 1865, is the oldest international organization in the world, with 193 member states and over 700 private sector entities."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1131, "end": 1247, "text": "Its membership includes some of the world's most influential tech companies, governments, and academic institutions."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1248, "end": 1319, "text": "\"We are thrilled to welcome Unterwachingen to the ITU family,\" said Dr."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1320, "end": 1355, "text": "Houlin Zhao, ITU Secretary-General."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1356, "end": 1486, "text": "\"Their enthusiasm for harnessing the power of technology to drive development and improve lives aligns perfectly with our mission."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1487, "end": 1561, "text": "We look forward to working closely with them to achieve our shared goals.\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1562, "end": 1767, "text": "As a member of the ITU, Unterwachingen will have access to a wealth of resources, including expertise, research, and best practices in areas such as 5G networks, artificial intelligence, and cybersecurity."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1768, "end": 1955, "text": "The municipality will also participate in ITU's global events, conferences, and workshops, providing a platform for its residents to engage with international experts and thought leaders."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1956, "end": 2172, "text": "According to data from the ITU, Unterwachingen's membership is expected to have a positive impact on the local economy, with estimates suggesting an increase in foreign investment and job creation in the tech sector."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2173, "end": 2222, "text": "\"This is a game-changer for our region,\" said Dr."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2223, "end": 2287, "text": "Maria Rodriguez, CEO of Unterwachingen-based startup, TechForge."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2288, "end": 2452, "text": "\"As a member of the ITU, we will be able to tap into a global network of innovators and entrepreneurs, which will help us to accelerate our growth and development.\""}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 55, "text": "Here is a potential Wikipedia entry for Unterwachingen:"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 57, "end": 71, "text": "Unterwachingen"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 73, "end": 157, "text": "Unterwachingen is a municipality located in the state of Baden-Württemberg, Germany."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 158, "end": 228, "text": "Membership in Kommunale Informationsverarbeitung Reutlingen-Ulm (KIRU)"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 230, "end": 406, "text": "Unterwachingen is a member of Kommunale Informationsverarbeitung Reutlingen-Ulm (KIRU), a company that provides information technology services to municipalities in the region."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 407, "end": 532, "text": "Evidence of this membership can be found on the KIRU website, which lists Unterwachingen as one of its member municipalities."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 533, "end": 660, "text": "[1] Additionally, the municipality's own website mentions its membership in KIRU, stating that it has been a member since 1992."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 661, "end": 664, "text": "[2]"}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 666, "end": 797, "text": "KIRU provides a range of services to its member municipalities, including IT consulting, software development, and data processing."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 798, "end": 933, "text": "As a member of KIRU, Unterwachingen is able to take advantage of these services to support its administrative and technical operations."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 934, "end": 945, "text": "References:"}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 947, "end": 1008, "text": "[1] Kommunale Informationsverarbeitung Reutlingen-Ulm (KIRU)."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1009, "end": 1016, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1017, "end": 1035, "text": "Mitgliedskommunen."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1036, "end": 1106, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.kiru.de\\/ueber-uns\\/mitgliedskommunen\\/>"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1108, "end": 1136, "text": "[2] Gemeinde Unterwachingen."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1137, "end": 1144, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1145, "end": 1202, "text": "KIRU - Kommunale Informationsverarbeitung Reutlingen-Ulm."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Unterwachingen", "scope": "Organization membership", "claim": "Unterwachingen is a member of Kommunale Informationsverarbeitung Reutlingen-Ulm (KIRU).", "answer": "Kommunale Informationsverarbeitung Reutlingen-Ulm (KIRU)", "quote": "Unterwachingen is a member of Kommunale Informationsverarbeitung Reutlingen-Ulm (KIRU), a company that provides information technology services to municipalities in the region. Evidence of this membership can be found on the KIRU website, which lists Unterwachingen as one of its member municipalities. [1] Additionally, the municipality's own website mentions its membership in KIRU, stating that it has been a member since 1992.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["International Telecommunication Union", "Kommunale Informationsverarbeitung Reutlingen-Ulm"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "International Telecommunication Union", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Kommunale Informationsverarbeitung Reutlingen-Ulm", "origin": "initial"}]}

